## Native rebuild vs JS reload

JS and styling changes hot-reload through Metro over the installed Debug build.

{{#if expo}}
A **full native rebuild** (`{{PM}} run ios` / `{{PM}} run android`) is required for:
{{else}}
A **full native rebuild** (`{{PM}} run ios` / `{{PM}} run android`, after `{{PM}} run pods` on iOS) is required for:
{{/if}}

- any new native module or any version bump of a native dep (reanimated/worklets especially)
- fonts, splash assets (replace `assets/logo.png`, then `{{PM}} run splash` on bare / `expo prebuild` on Expo), app icons
- Firebase config files, deep-link / URL scheme changes, permissions in Info.plist / AndroidManifest
{{#if expo}}
- any change to `app.json` / `app.config.ts` plugins (re-run `{{PM}} run prebuild`)
{{/if}}

Symptom of forgetting: "the fix didn't work" when it was never loaded.
{{#if nativewind}}
After editing design tokens or `tailwind.config.js`, or bumping reanimated, restart Metro with `--reset-cache`.
{{else}}
After bumping reanimated or editing babel config, restart Metro with `--reset-cache`.
{{/if}}

## Architecture & conventions

- Layout follows the mobile architecture template §17: `src/app` (app-level controllers, Providers, ErrorBoundary), `src/navigation`, `src/screens/<name>` (stateful `Screen` + stateless `Content`, fixtures in `__fixtures__`), `src/components` (primitives only), `src/features`, `src/store`, `src/lib`, `src/config`, `src/theme`, `src/i18n`, `src/validations`, `src/hooks`, `src/types`.
- Import alias `@/` → `src/` (tsconfig paths, Metro resolver, jest moduleNameMapper all agree — keep them in sync).
- Screens compose primitives from `src/components`; no raw `Text`/`TouchableOpacity` in screens.
{{#if rtkQuery}}
- Server data: one RTK Query api file per resource; unwrap envelopes with `pickData` in `src/store/api/helpers.ts` — document the envelope nesting per endpoint there.
{{/if}}
{{#if tanstack}}
- Server data: query hooks per resource in `src/features/<domain>/api.ts`; keys are arrays `[domain, id]`; unwrap envelopes in one helper.
{{/if}}
{{#if rhf}}
- Every form: zod schema in `src/validations/`, resolver via `@hookform/resolvers/zod`.
{{/if}}
- Native-stub registry: every native dep gets a jest stub in `jest/` wired via `moduleNameMapper` the day it is added.
- Secrets: anything in the JS bundle is extractable. `.env*` carries publishable keys only; `.env.example` documents every key.

## Gotchas (learned the hard way)

- RNTL v14 `render` is async — forgetting `await` yields an empty tree, not an error.
{{#if flashList}}
- FlashList 2 is JS-only and New-Arch-only; the jest stub swaps it for `FlatList`.
{{/if}}
{{#if mmkv}}
- MMKV 4 is `createMMKV()`, not `new MMKV()`; `remove()` replaced `delete()`.
{{/if}}
- Reanimated 4.4.x silently drops animated updates in native-stack screens on Android — stay on ≥ 4.5.0.

